"\n<a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"reading-progress\"><span id=\"reading-progress\"></span></div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"route-curtain\" id=\"route-curtain\"><div class=\"curtain-brand\">showset<span>.</span></div></div>\n<header class=\"site-header\" id=\"site-header\">\n<div class=\"header-inner\">\n<a aria-label=\"SHOWSET home\" class=\"brand\" href=\"#home\"><img class=\"approved-wordmark\" src=\"/brand/approved-wordmark.png\" alt=\"SHOWSET — events &amp; creative agency\" width=\"962\" height=\"250\"/></a>\n<nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\" class=\"desktop-navigation\">\n<div class=\"nav-dropdown\" id=\"nav-dropdown\">\n<button aria-controls=\"nav-panel\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"nav-text dropdown-button\" id=\"services-button\">What we do <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewbox=\"0 0 12 12\"><path d=\"m2.5 4.5 3.5 3.5 3.5-3.5\"></path></svg></button>\n<div aria-label=\"Service categories\" class=\"nav-panel\" id=\"nav-panel\">\n<a href=\"#events\">Events &amp; experiences <b>↗</b></a>\n<a href=\"#creative\">Creative &amp; design <b>↗</b></a>\n<a href=\"#digital\">Digital &amp; marketing <b>↗</b></a>\n<a href=\"#production\">Content &amp; production <b>↗</b></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<a class=\"nav-text\" href=\"#studio\">Our studio</a><a class=\"nav-text\" href=\"#work\">Our work</a><a class=\"nav-text\" href=\"#contact\">Contact</a>\n</nav>\n<a class=\"header-cta\" href=\"#contact\">Let’s talk <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"round-icon\">↗</span></a>\n<button aria-controls=\"mobile-panel\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" class=\"mobile-toggle\" id=\"mobile-toggle\"><span></span><span></span></button>\n</div>\n</header>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mobile-panel\" id=\"mobile-panel\">\n<nav aria-label=\"Mobile navigation\"><a href=\"#home\">Home</a><a href=\"#events\">Events &amp; experiences</a><a href=\"#creative\">Creative &amp; design</a><a href=\"#digital\">Digital &amp; marketing</a><a href=\"#production\">Content &amp; production</a><a href=\"#studio\">Our studio</a><a href=\"#work\">Our work</a><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></nav>\n<div class=\"mobile-signature\">Big ideas. Every detail. Memorable experiences.</div>\n</div>\n<main id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"view is-current\" data-view=\"home\">\n<!-- FIRST ACT: one strong image, no floating picture elements -->\n<section aria-label=\"SHOWSET introduction\" class=\"hero-track\" id=\"hero-track\">\n<div class=\"hero-stage\" id=\"hero-stage\">\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hero-ambient\"></div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hero-photo\" id=\"hero-photo\"><img alt=\"\" fetchpriority=\"high\" src=\"/concept-12/857bfe33201dcedbc6c9.webp\"/><div class=\"hero-photo-wash\"></div><div class=\"hero-photo-reflection\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"hero-foreground\" id=\"hero-foreground\">\n<h1 class=\"hero-title\"><span class=\"line\"><span>Great ideas</span></span> <span class=\"line hero-accent-phrase\"><span>should move</span></span> <span class=\"line hero-accent-phrase\"><span>people<span class=\"hero-period\">.</span></span></span></h1>\n<p>And they should go places. Into rooms. Across screens. Onto stages. Into the hands and heads of real people. We bring events and creative work together to make sure they do.</p>\n<div class=\"hero-links\"><a class=\"solid-link\" href=\"#services\">See what we do <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"text-arrow-link\" href=\"#studio\">Get to know us <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hero-second\" id=\"hero-second\" aria-hidden=\"true\" inert><h2 class=\"wipe-heading\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>An idea is a start.</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>We bring it to life.</span></span></h2><p class=\"hero-second-copy\">We take the good part of “what if?” and turn it into something you can actually experience. From the first sketch to the final detail, we connect the ideas, people and production that bring it to life.</p><div class=\"hero-second-links\"><a class=\"solid-link\" href=\"#services\">See what we do <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"text-arrow-link\" href=\"#studio\">Get to know us <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hero-graphic\"></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Editorial transition -->\n<section class=\"manifesto section-gutter\" id=\"discover\">\n<div class=\"manifesto-grid\">\n<div class=\"manifesto-heading-group\"><h2 class=\"section-title plain-heading\"><span class=\"plain-line\">Too good to leave</span><span class=\"plain-line accent-text\">on the drawing board.</span></h2><a class=\"understated-link\" href=\"#studio\">Meet the people behind it <span>↗</span></a></div>\n<div class=\"manifesto-copy\"><p>You know that feeling when an idea clicks and suddenly you can see the whole thing? We live for that part. But we love what happens next even more. The planning. The pixels. The people. The power cables. The tiny decisions nobody notices until they are done right. We connect creative thinking with the practical craft it takes to bring a concept into the world. So the work does more than look impressive. It feels right, behaves right and makes people want to be part of it.</p></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- THIRD ACT: full-frame scroll storyboard -->\n<section aria-label=\"From imagination to impact\" class=\"film-track\" id=\"film-track\">\n<div class=\"film-stage\" id=\"film-stage\">\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"film-images\">\n<div class=\"film-image is-on\" data-film-image=\"0\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/concept-12/857bfe33201dcedbc6c9.webp\"/></div>\n<div class=\"film-image\" data-film-image=\"1\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/concept-12/cacc0a760b075d1ccf18.webp\"/></div>\n<div class=\"film-image\" data-film-image=\"2\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/concept-12/900abdb6d28df2c511ea.webp\"/></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"film-veil\"></div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"film-gridline\"></div>\n<div class=\"film-story-inner\">\n<div class=\"film-steps\" id=\"film-steps\">\n<article class=\"film-step is-on\" data-film-step=\"0\"><h2 class=\"wipe-heading\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>First, we</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>imagine it.</span></span></h2><p>We get curious. Ask the awkwardly good questions. Pull things apart. Put unexpected things together. And find the idea worth chasing.</p></article>\n<article class=\"film-step\" data-film-step=\"1\"><h2 class=\"wipe-heading\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>Then, we</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>make it happen.</span></span></h2><p>We design it, plan it, prototype it, build it and work through the bits nobody sees. This is where imagination meets the production schedule.</p></article>\n<article class=\"film-step\" data-film-step=\"2\"><h2 class=\"wipe-heading\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>Finally, we</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>move people.</span></span></h2><p>The doors open. The launch goes live. The audience leans in. Everything clicks into place and the idea stops being an idea.</p></article>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"film-progress\"><span class=\"film-progress-fill\" id=\"film-progress-fill\"></span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- FOURTH ACT: a single visual focus, services are not cards -->\n\n<section aria-label=\"Explore our four service categories\" class=\"services-track\" id=\"services-track\">\n<div class=\"services-stage\">\n<div class=\"services-left\">\n<div class=\"services-stage-intro\" id=\"services\">\n<h2 class=\"services-panel-heading\"><span>Different disciplines<span class=\"service-heading-period\">.</span></span><span class=\"accent-text\">One connected team.</span></h2>\n<p>A launch might need an identity. An event might need a digital home. A campaign might need a film, a space or a piece of technology to make it work. We move between all four worlds so the idea stays in one piece.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"service-navigation\">\n<a class=\"discipline is-on\" data-service=\"0\" href=\"#events\"><span class=\"discipline-name\">Events &amp; experiences</span><span class=\"discipline-arrow\">↗</span></a>\n<a class=\"discipline\" data-service=\"1\" href=\"#creative\"><span class=\"discipline-name\">Creative &amp; design</span><span class=\"discipline-arrow\">↗</span></a>\n<a class=\"discipline\" data-service=\"2\" href=\"#digital\"><span class=\"discipline-name\">Digital &amp; marketing</span><span class=\"discipline-arrow\">↗</span></a>\n<a class=\"discipline\" data-service=\"3\" href=\"#production\"><span class=\"discipline-name\">Content &amp; production</span><span class=\"discipline-arrow\">↗</span></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"services-right\" id=\"services-right\">\n<div class=\"service-visual is-on\" data-service-visual=\"0\"><img alt=\"Atmospheric outdoor event with warm lights\" src=\"/concept-12/900abdb6d28df2c511ea.webp\"/></div>\n<div class=\"service-visual\" data-service-visual=\"1\"><img alt=\"Carefully designed SHOWSET brand materials\" src=\"/concept-12/7f12ec7b20911ecee355.webp\"/></div>\n<div class=\"service-visual service-digital\" data-service-visual=\"2\"><div class=\"digital-stage\"><div class=\"digital-screen\"><div class=\"digital-top\"><span>showset<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></span></div><div class=\"digital-type\">THE NEXT<br/><em>BIG THING<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></em></div><div class=\"digital-bottom\"><span>Ideas with purpose.</span></div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"service-visual\" data-service-visual=\"3\"><img alt=\"Hands on a professional sound mixing desk\" src=\"/concept-12/aa01c56d7f9e7726002f.webp\"/></div>\n<div class=\"service-image-overlay\"></div>\n<div class=\"service-image-information\"><p id=\"service-visual-copy\">We imagine, produce and deliver experiences that bring people together.</p><a aria-label=\"Explore Events &amp; experiences\" href=\"#events\" id=\"service-visual-link\">Step inside this world <span>↗</span></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- FEATURED STORIES: three-column, horizontally advancing case studies -->\n<section class=\"portfolio-section section-gutter\" id=\"portfolio-section\">\n<div class=\"portfolio-heading\"><h2 class=\"section-title block-heading\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>The thinking</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>behind the thing.</span></span></h2><div class=\"portfolio-intro\"><p>A little more than a final image. We like to show what makes an idea work: the intention, the atmosphere, the choices and the craft. Here are a few creative explorations that take you behind the scenes of how we think.</p></div></div>\n<div aria-label=\"Featured creative explorations\" aria-roledescription=\"carousel\" class=\"case-carousel\" id=\"case-carousel\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\">\n<div class=\"case-viewport\">\n<div aria-live=\"off\" class=\"case-rail\" id=\"case-rail\">\n<a aria-label=\"Explore creative study: Atmosphere is everything\" class=\"case-slide is-active\" data-case-slide=\"0\" href=\"#case-events\">\n<div class=\"case-photo\"><img alt=\"Warm, beautifully lit outdoor event scene\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/concept-12/900abdb6d28df2c511ea.webp\"/></div>\n<div class=\"case-story\"><h3>Atmosphere is everything<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></h3><p>You can plan the programme. The feeling is what makes people stay.</p><span class=\"case-slide-link\">Explore the study <b>↗</b></span></div>\n</a>\n<a aria-label=\"Explore creative study: Made to be remembered\" class=\"case-slide\" data-case-slide=\"1\" href=\"#case-identity\">\n<div class=\"case-photo\"><img alt=\"SHOWSET creative identity and designed brand materials\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/concept-12/7f12ec7b20911ecee355.webp\"/></div>\n<div class=\"case-story\"><h3>Made to be remembered<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></h3><p>Identity is built in a thousand little encounters, not one big reveal.</p><span class=\"case-slide-link\">Explore the study <b>↗</b></span></div>\n</a>\n<a aria-label=\"Explore creative study: Behind every moment\" class=\"case-slide\" data-case-slide=\"2\" href=\"#case-production\">\n<div class=\"case-photo\"><img alt=\"Hands adjusting sound equipment during event production\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/concept-12/aa01c56d7f9e7726002f.webp\"/></div>\n<div class=\"case-story\"><h3>Behind every moment<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></h3><p>The quiet precision that makes a big production feel effortless.</p><span class=\"case-slide-link\">Explore the study <b>↗</b></span></div>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"case-controls\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"case-progress\"><span class=\"case-progress-bar\" id=\"case-progress-bar\"></span></div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- ORIGINAL V2 TREATMENT: the single teal dot grows to fill the view -->\n<section aria-label=\"SHOWSET approach\" class=\"dot-track\" id=\"dot-track\">\n<div class=\"dot-stage\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"dot-core\" id=\"dot-core\"></div>\n<div class=\"dot-words\"><h2>Serious about the <em>details.</em><br/>Wild about the <em>possibilities<span>.</span></em></h2><p>The small stuff is never small when you are making something big.</p></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"end-section section-gutter\" id=\"ending\"><h2 class=\"section-title plain-heading\"><span class=\"plain-line\">Got a beautifully</span><span class=\"plain-line accent-text\">complicated idea?</span></h2><div class=\"end-bottom\"><p>The brief can be polished, half-written or still living entirely in your head. Tell us what you are trying to make happen. We know where to start.</p><a class=\"solid-link end-link\" href=\"#contact\">Let’s make a plan <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></section>\n</div>\n<!-- Dynamic service page, each category has its own route -->\n<div class=\"view\" data-view=\"service\">\n<section class=\"category-hero\" id=\"category-hero\"><div class=\"category-bg\"><img alt=\"\" data-depth-image=\"\" id=\"category-image\" src=\"/concept-12/900abdb6d28df2c511ea.webp\"/></div><div class=\"category-gradient\"></div><div class=\"category-inner\"><h1 class=\"block-heading\" id=\"category-title\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>Events &amp;</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>experiences.</span></span></h1><p id=\"category-description\">The room. The crowd. The goosebumps. The perfectly timed reveal. We bring bold ideas and meticulous planning together to turn gatherings into experiences.</p><a class=\"solid-link\" href=\"#contact\">Plan something brilliant <span>↗</span></a></div></section>\n<section class=\"category-detail section-gutter\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\" id=\"category-belief\">It's about how it feels.</h2><div class=\"category-detail-bottom\"><p id=\"category-belief-copy\"></p></div><div class=\"category-clusters\"><div class=\"category-clusters-title\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\">How we bring it together.</h2><p>Different parts. One connected idea.</p></div><div class=\"cluster-grid\" id=\"category-clusters\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"category-feature\" id=\"category-feature\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\" id=\"category-feature-title\"></h2><p id=\"category-feature-copy\"></p></div>\n<div class=\"category-process\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\">From the first thought to the final detail.</h2><div class=\"process-grid\" id=\"category-process-list\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"category-capabilities\"><div class=\"category-capabilities-head\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\">Explore the possibilities.</h2><p>More ways we can help, depending on your brief.</p></div><div class=\"capabilities-list\" id=\"category-capabilities-list\"></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"category-banner\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"category-banner\" src=\"/concept-12/cacc0a760b075d1ccf18.webp\"/><div class=\"category-banner-shade\"></div><div><h2 class=\"block-heading\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>Let's make</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>it memorable<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></span></span></h2><a class=\"solid-link\" href=\"#contact\">Bring us your brief <span>↗</span></a></div></section>\n<section class=\"category-more section-gutter\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\">Keep exploring<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></h2><div id=\"category-more-links\"></div></section>\n</div>\n<!-- Supporting pages -->\n<div class=\"view\" data-view=\"studio\"><section class=\"simple-hero studio-hero\"><div class=\"simple-bg\"><img alt=\"\" data-depth-image=\"\" src=\"/concept-12/857bfe33201dcedbc6c9.webp\"/></div><div class=\"simple-shade\"></div><div class=\"simple-hero-content\"><h1 class=\"block-heading\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>Curious minds.</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>Capable hands<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></span></span></h1><p>We ask big questions, make ambitious plans and care a slightly unreasonable amount about the finishing touches.</p></div></section><section class=\"studio-copy section-gutter\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\">We like our ideas<br/><em>out in the wild.</em></h2><p>We are not interested in good ideas that only look good in presentations. We want them out in the world, doing what they were made to do. Drawing a crowd. Starting a conversation. Making something easier. Giving a brand a point of view. Making a room feel different. That is why we connect events and creative thinking under one roof. Strategy, design, digital, production and the people who make it all happen belong in the same conversation. One idea can become many things without losing its personality along the way.</p><div class=\"values\"><article><span>01</span><h3>Curiosity first</h3><p>We would rather ask one more good question than rush towards the obvious answer.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Craft everywhere</h3><p>A stage build and a tiny button deserve the same attention to detail, even if the tools are different.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>People at the centre</h3><p>We think about the audience, the client and everyone involved in making the experience work.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"studio-belief section-gutter\"><div><h2 class=\"soft-rise\">Heads in the clouds.<br/><em>Feet on the floor plan.</em></h2></div><p>We love the wild first thought. We also love the spreadsheet that makes it happen. A strong concept needs both imagination and organisation, and we are quite happy moving between the two. It is how we can be adventurous without being careless.</p></section>\n<section class=\"studio-rhythm section-gutter\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\">How we work.</h2><div class=\"rhythm-grid\"><article><h3>Listen properly.</h3><p>We want to know what matters, what is possible and what would make this worth doing.</p></article><article><h3>Think freely.</h3><p>We explore routes worth taking and bring the strongest idea into focus.</p></article><article><h3>Make deliberately.</h3><p>We design, plan, produce and keep an eye on the details as the idea takes shape.</p></article><article><h3>Finish with pride.</h3><p>We test, refine, deliver and make sure the last detail gets the same attention as the first.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"studio-partnership section-gutter\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\">One brief. Fewer handovers.<br/><em>Better conversations.</em></h2><div><p>Some projects need the whole team of disciplines. Some just need one good specialist brain. We work with what the brief calls for, whether it is a single design, a full event, a digital platform or a long-term creative partnership. The point is to make the process feel connected, clear and genuinely collaborative.</p><a class=\"understated-link\" href=\"#contact\">Come say hello <span>↗</span></a></div></section><section class=\"studio-faq section-gutter\"><div class=\"studio-faq-heading\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\">Good questions. Better conversations.</h2><p>Here are a few useful things to know before we start.</p></div><div class=\"studio-faq-list\"><details><summary>What kind of projects do we take on?<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p>We work across events, brand and graphic design, digital experiences, marketing, content and production. Some briefs need one discipline. Others need several. We choose the shape of the work around the goal, not the other way around.</p></details><details><summary>Can we handle a project from idea to execution?<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p>Yes, that is one of the strengths of bringing creative thinking and event production into the same conversation. We can help shape the concept, design the assets and coordinate the work needed to bring it to life, with the right specialists where needed.</p></details><details><summary>Do we work on individual services too?<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p>Absolutely. You might need an identity, event layout, website, campaign, motion graphic or a helping hand with creative production. We do not need to turn every brief into a giant project.</p></details><details><summary>Can we join an existing marketing or event team?<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p>Yes. We can work alongside internal teams, agencies and event stakeholders, taking responsibility for a clearly defined part of the work or supporting across several disciplines.</p></details><details><summary>What if the idea is not fully formed yet?<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p>That is a perfectly good place to start. We can help turn the rough thought into a useful brief, clarify what matters and work out what it would take to deliver.</p></details><details><summary>Do we only create events for businesses?<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p>No. We work with both corporate and private experiences. What matters to us is making the occasion feel considered, appropriate and genuinely personal to the people there.</p></details><details><summary>Can we support a brand after the launch?<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p>Yes. We offer ongoing creative and marketing partnerships for businesses that need a steady stream of content, design, marketing thinking or digital support.</p></details><details><summary>Can we help with event suppliers and production partners?<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p>We can build supplier and production requirements into an event plan and help source or coordinate the relevant services. The scope, responsibilities and final supplier arrangements are agreed for each brief.</p></details><details><summary>Do we work on projects outside our immediate area?<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p>Project location, travel and on-site support depend on the brief. Tell us where you need us and we can discuss the practical approach.</p></details><details><summary>How do we get started?<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p>Tell us what you have in mind, what you hope it will achieve and any timing or budget parameters you know. We can take the conversation from there.</p></details></div></section><section class=\"studio-final section-gutter\"><div class=\"studio-final-inner\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\">We should probably meet.</h2><p>Tell us what you are working on. We will bring the questions, the ideas and the practical thinking.</p><a class=\"understated-link\" href=\"#contact\">Come say hello <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></section></div>\n<div class=\"view\" data-view=\"work\">\n<section class=\"simple-hero work-hero\"><div class=\"simple-bg\"><img alt=\"Event production scene\" data-depth-image=\"\" src=\"/concept-12/cacc0a760b075d1ccf18.webp\"/></div><div class=\"simple-shade\"></div><div class=\"simple-hero-content\"><h1 class=\"block-heading\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>The story is</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>in the making.</span></span></h1><p>The polished final frame is only part of it. We are interested in the decisions that made it possible, the thinking that gave it shape and the feeling it leaves behind.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"work-page-gallery section-gutter\"><div class=\"work-editorial-note\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise work-intro-title\">Creative explorations.</h2><p>Explore three creative studies from our world. They are a closer look at the ingredients we care about: atmosphere, identity and the behind-the-scenes craft that makes the idea work. Think of them as windows into how we approach a brief, not claims of completed client projects.</p></div><div class=\"case-index\">\n<a class=\"case-index-item\" href=\"#case-events\"><div class=\"case-index-image\"><img alt=\"Warmly lit outdoor event setting\" data-depth-image=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/concept-12/900abdb6d28df2c511ea.webp\"/></div><div class=\"case-index-info\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\">Atmosphere is everything<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></h2><p>A room is never just a room. The arrival, the lighting, the sound and the unexpected little detail all have something to say.</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></div></a>\n<a class=\"case-index-item\" href=\"#case-identity\"><div class=\"case-index-image\"><img alt=\"Considered brand design details\" data-depth-image=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/concept-12/7f12ec7b20911ecee355.webp\"/></div><div class=\"case-index-info\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\">Made to be remembered<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></h2><p>A brand gets built every time someone meets it. One voice, many touchpoints, a thousand tiny clues.</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></div></a>\n<a class=\"case-index-item\" href=\"#case-production\"><div class=\"case-index-image\"><img alt=\"Sound production equipment\" data-depth-image=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/concept-12/aa01c56d7f9e7726002f.webp\"/></div><div class=\"case-index-info\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\">Behind every moment<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></h2><p>The best production looks effortless because so much of the effort happened before the doors opened.</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></div></a>\n</div></section></div>\n<div class=\"view\" data-view=\"case-study\">\n<section class=\"case-detail-hero\"><div class=\"case-detail-photo\"><img alt=\"\" data-depth-image=\"\" id=\"case-detail-image\" src=\"/concept-12/900abdb6d28df2c511ea.webp\"/></div><div class=\"case-detail-wash\"></div><div class=\"case-detail-header section-gutter\"><h1 id=\"case-detail-title\">Atmosphere is everything<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></h1><p id=\"case-detail-intro\"></p></div></section>\n<section class=\"case-detail-body section-gutter\"><div class=\"case-detail-introduction\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\" id=\"case-detail-belief\"></h2><p id=\"case-detail-description\"></p></div><blockquote class=\"case-quote\" id=\"case-detail-quote\"></blockquote><div class=\"case-detail-visual\"><img alt=\"Creative process imagery\" data-depth-image=\"\" id=\"case-detail-second-image\" src=\"/concept-12/f778ffc756368369e22f.webp\"/></div><div class=\"case-detail-next\"><p>A good idea deserves a good ending. What could yours become?</p><a class=\"understated-link\" href=\"#contact\">Start a conversation <span>↗</span></a></div></section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"view\" data-view=\"contact\"><section class=\"contact-view section-gutter\"><div class=\"contact-shell\"><div class=\"contact-left\"><h1 class=\"block-heading\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>Something</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>brewing?</span></span></h1><p>A fully formed brief is welcome. So is a wildly ambitious idea, a rough sketch or a sentence that starts with “This might sound crazy...” We are listening.</p><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"contact-orbit\"><span></span></div></div><form class=\"contact-form\" id=\"contact-form\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\">Tell us the interesting bit.</h2><label for=\"full-name\">Your name</label><input autocomplete=\"name\" id=\"full-name\" name=\"name\" placeholder=\"What should we call you?\" required=\"\"/><label for=\"email\">Email address</label><input autocomplete=\"email\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Somewhere we can get back to you\" required=\"\" type=\"email\"/><label for=\"company\">Company or organisation</label><input autocomplete=\"organization\" id=\"company\" name=\"company\" placeholder=\"Optional, if there is one\"/><label for=\"project-type\">What are we making?</label><div class=\"custom-select\" id=\"project-combobox\"><select class=\"native-select-fallback\" id=\"project-type\" name=\"type\"><option value=\"\">Choose the closest fit</option><option>An event or experience</option><option>A brand or design project</option><option>A website or digital solution</option><option>Marketing and content</option><option>Film or production</option><option>A bit of everything</option><option>Not quite sure yet</option></select><button aria-controls=\"project-options\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-label=\"What are we making?\" class=\"select-trigger\" id=\"project-trigger\" role=\"combobox\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"select-value\">Choose the closest fit</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewbox=\"0 0 12 12\"><path d=\"m2.5 4.5 3.5 3.5 3.5-3.5\"></path></svg></button><div aria-label=\"Project type\" class=\"select-panel\" id=\"project-options\" role=\"listbox\"><button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"select-option\" data-value=\"An event or experience\" role=\"option\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\">An event or experience</button><button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"select-option\" data-value=\"A brand or design project\" role=\"option\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\">A brand or design project</button><button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"select-option\" data-value=\"A website or digital solution\" role=\"option\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\">A website or digital solution</button><button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"select-option\" data-value=\"Marketing and content\" role=\"option\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\">Marketing and content</button><button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"select-option\" data-value=\"Film or production\" role=\"option\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\">Film or production</button><button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"select-option\" data-value=\"A bit of everything\" role=\"option\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\">A bit of everything</button><button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"select-option\" data-value=\"Not quite sure yet\" role=\"option\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\">Not quite sure yet</button></div></div><label for=\"message\">Tell us about it</label><textarea id=\"message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"The idea, the challenge, the deadline, the wonderfully complicated bits. Start anywhere.\" required=\"\" rows=\"4\"></textarea><label for=\"project-date\">When is it happening?</label><input id=\"project-date\" name=\"date\" placeholder=\"Optional: a date, month or ‘we are still figuring it out’\"/><label for=\"project-budget\">Rough budget</label><input id=\"project-budget\" name=\"budget\" placeholder=\"Optional, to help us suggest the right way forward\"/><button class=\"solid-link\" type=\"submit\">Send the idea <span>↗</span></button><p class=\"form-note\">You do not need to have all the answers. That is what the conversation is for. This preview form does not send messages.</p><p class=\"form-result\" id=\"form-result\" role=\"status\"></p></form></div></section></div>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"footer\"><div class=\"footer-head\"><div class=\"footer-identity\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"#home\"><img class=\"approved-wordmark\" src=\"/brand/approved-wordmark.png\" alt=\"SHOWSET — events &amp; creative agency\" width=\"962\" height=\"250\"/></a><p>We think it through. We make it happen.<br/>We make it feel like something.</p></div><div class=\"footer-links\"><div><span>DISCOVER</span><a href=\"#home\">Home</a><a href=\"#studio\">Our studio</a><a href=\"#work\">Our work</a><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></div><div><span>WHAT WE DO</span><a href=\"#events\">Events &amp; experiences</a><a href=\"#creative\">Creative &amp; design</a><a href=\"#digital\">Digital &amp; marketing</a><a href=\"#production\">Content &amp; production</a></div></div><div class=\"footer-contact\"><span class=\"footer-column-title\">CONTACT US</span><a data-footer-email href=\"mailto:hello@showset.co.za\">hello@showset.co.za</a><a data-footer-phone href=\"tel:+27682805777\">+27 68 280 5777</a><span data-footer-location>Cape Town, South Africa</span><div class=\"footer-socials\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Social media\"><a class=\"footer-social\" data-footer-social=\"facebook\" aria-label=\"Facebook\" aria-disabled=\"true\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 2h-3a5 5 0 0 0-5 5v3H7v4h3v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3\"/></svg></a><a class=\"footer-social\" data-footer-social=\"instagram\" aria-label=\"Instagram\" aria-disabled=\"true\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"2\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M17.5 6.5h.01\"/></svg></a><a class=\"footer-social\" data-footer-social=\"linkedin\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn\" aria-disabled=\"true\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z\"/><rect x=\"2\" y=\"9\" width=\"4\" height=\"12\"/><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"4\" r=\"2\"/></svg></a></div></div></div><div class=\"footer-bottom\"><span>© <span id=\"year\">2026</span> SHOWSET. All rights reserved.</s